Bill of Materials (BOM)

| Qty | Component | Purpose |

| 1 | Arduino Uno R3 | The main microcontroller running the radar and alarm logic. |
| 1 | HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor | Mounted on the servo to sweep and detect distance. |
| 1 | Micro Servo Motor | Sweeps 180 degrees to create the radar perimeter. |
| 1 | Piezo Buzzer | Sounds a warning beep or continuous breach alarm. |
| 1 | Green LED | Visual indicator for standby/safe mode. |
| 1 | Yellow LED | Visual indicator for an initial perimeter warning. |
| 1 | Red LED | Visual indicator for a close-proximity breach. |
| 3 | 220Ω Resistors | Protects the LEDs from burning out. |
| 1 | Breadboard | Routes power and ground connections. |
| 22 | Jumper Wires | Connects components to the Arduino pins. |
